{"v":1,"st":"NV","e":"2024-11-05","src":{"carson-city-summary":["Carson City Clerk-Recorder: Summary Results Report, General Election, November 5, 2024","https://www.carsoncity.gov/home/showpublisheddocument/90421/638676020050300000","official",1,"2026-10-23","c7fd4d9da2d6a68fb9b7f6922d961ccb6096b9314b7f18f5de8895f7a2a41769",0],"churchill-summary":["Churchill County Clerk-Treasurer: Election Summary Report, General Election, November 5, 2024","https://www.churchillcountynv.gov/ArchiveCenter/ViewFile/Item/1403","official",1,"2026-10-23","1bf13f6a83715c15ccd9b05daa80956b147a97e471c87dc7f28ccef57576a20a",1],"clark-official":["Clark County Election Department: 24G Official Election Results","https://elections.clarkcountynv.gov/electionresultsTV/results.aspx","official",1,"2026-10-23","d8bc5595d13d2d3ad1d8fa65ff0976665b308d4b28d5846e7828f3ae6b1f0321",2],"clerk-statistics":["Office of the Clerk, U.S. House of Representatives: Statistics of the Presidential and Congressional Election of November 5, 2024","https://clerk.house.gov/member_info/electionInfo/2024/statistics2024.pdf","official",1,"2026-10-16","d4ba800fc17135b616ae556c92861080ab962d95916ace34b546c5aac824aec4",3],"douglas-summary":["Douglas County Clerk-Treasurer: GE24 Certification of the Election (Election Summary Report)","https://cltr.douglascountynv.gov/UserFiles/Servers/Server_18102038/File/Elections/2024/GE24/GE24%20Certification%20of%20the%20Election.pdf","official",1,"2026-10-23","078193fdbab4a44f1be7f35c1933a1c4f2a1d28a7965d0206fb6c04be85d96fc",4],"humboldt-summary":["Humboldt County Clerk: Election Summary Report, General Election, November 5, 2024","https://humboldtcountynv.gov/DocumentCenter/View/7892","official",1,"2026-10-23","908135a5304b036d369584eec6278d727c5f0ef3f085abd77bc75c98836e9da2",5],"white-pine-summary":["White Pine County Clerk: 2024 General Election Canvass and Abstract (Summary Report)","https://www.whitepinecounty.net/DocumentCenter/View/10740","official",1,"2026-10-23","c0992b8e62019557193498e8db489da72e6aa7c90c71ecc66a65b4bf87a45584",6]},"notes":["Headed 'Summary Results Report OFFICIAL RESULTS', generated 11/13/2024; listed under '2024 General Election, November 5' on the city's Election Results and Historical Information page. Read for the city's figures.","The report prints 'Churchill Summary FINAL' (11/13/2024); the county's Election Results archive lists it as '2024 General Election - Official Final Results'. Pages read: 1 to 7 of the PDF; the report prints 'Churchill Summary FINAL' (11/13/2024 8:53:14 AM).","The county's results page with this election and 'OFFICIAL ELECTION RESULTS' chosen: each contest's county figures and its 'VOTE FOR' count; the page bolds the leading names. It prints no party.","Compiled by the Clerk from official sources; Nevada's section on page 43 of the PDF. Read for the federal contests' statewide figures (the control) and winners. The copy on this computer was saved by another state's loader (states_cache/al_local/clerk_statistics2024.pdf).","The county's certification package: the certified Abstract of Votes Cast, then the Election Summary Report headed 'GE24 Official Results' (11/14/2024), which is the part read. Pages read: 3 to 11 of the PDF; the report prints 'GE24 Official Results' (11/14/2024 2:43:36 PM).","The report prints neither 'official' nor 'unofficial' (11/13/2024); the county's Elections page lists it among the 2024 General Election's 'Official and Final' results, beside the signed Canvass and Abstract. Pages read: 1 to 7 of the PDF; the report itself prints no word about being official or final (11/13/2024 12:27:17 PM).","The county's canvass and abstract of the vote; its Summary Report pages print 'FINAL ELECTION RESULTS' (11/11/2024). Pages read: 4 to 9 of the PDF; the report prints 'FINAL ELECTION RESULTS' (11/11/2024 11:37:08 AM)."],"gaps":[["county","Clark County: small precincts' figures","Clark County's Statement of Vote prints '*' in place of the figures of a precinct with too few voters to keep a ballot secret; those precinct cells are not stored, and the county's official figures include them.","https://elections.clarkcountynv.gov/electionresultsTV/results.aspx"],["county","Clark County: 3,487 precinct figures by kind of vote whose total is hidden","The county hides each kind of vote (Election Day, Early Vote, Mail) and the precinct's total on their own; where a precinct's total for a choice is hidden ('*') but one or more of its kinds is printed (often a 0 for mail), those printed kinds are left out too, since a precinct's figures by kind of vote are stored only beside its total. The county's official figures include them.","https://elections.clarkcountynv.gov/electionresultsTV/results.aspx"],["state","The Secretary of State's statewide canvass","The Secretary of State's results sites (www.nvsos.gov, silverstateelection.nv.gov) answer programs with an Incapsula bot wall, so the statewide canvass (every county's figures for the statewide, multi-county and federal contests) is not read; John can save it in his own browser.","https://silverstateelection.nv.gov/"],["county","Washoe County","Washoe County's website (www.washoecounty.gov) served this computer normally on 2026-10-01, but from 2026-10-23 its web firewall answers every request with an empty 404, so it is not asked; the county's past-results pages can be saved in John's own browser.","https://www.washoecounty.gov/voters/2024-election/2024-election-files/ElectionSummaryReportRPT_Official.pdf"],["county","Elko County","Elko County's canvass and abstract is a scanned document whose text layer is machine reading of the scan (some figures come apart, such as '13 .89%'); it is not read by a program.","https://elkocountynv.gov/departments/clerk/2025/2024%20General%20Canvass_signed.pdf"],["county","Esmeralda County","No website of Esmeralda County's with election results was found.",""],["county","Eureka County","Eureka County's canvass and abstract is a scan with a poor text layer, and its statement of votes cast was found only as a records-request copy that is not marked official.","https://www.eurekacountynv.gov/departments/clerk-recorder/elections/"],["county","Lander County","Lander County's canvass is a scanned document with no text layer.","https://www.landercountynv.org/government/clerk/election_information.php"],["county","Lincoln County","No results document was found on Lincoln County's website.","https://lincolncountynv.org/departments/clerks-office/elections/"],["county","Lyon County","Lyon County's official results are scanned pages with no text layer.","https://www.lyon-county.org/801/Elections"],["county","Mineral County","No results document was found on Mineral County's website.","https://mineralcountynv.us/government/clerk_treasurer/election.php"],["county","Nye County","Nye County's posted results are scanned pages; the commission's canvass item carries a text layer printed sideways from a scan; neither is read by a program.","https://www.nyecountynv.gov/1144/Past-Elections"],["county","Pershing County","Pershing County's canvass is a scanned document with no text layer.","https://www.pershingcountynv.gov/government/clerk-treasurer/elections.php"],["county","Storey County","Storey County's summary prints 'FINAL', not official, and its elections page no longer lists it.","https://www.storeycounty.org/208/Election-Information"]],"chk":{"n":22,"ok":22,"not":[]},"cty":{"32001":"Churchill County","32003":"Clark County","32005":"Douglas County","32013":"Humboldt County","32033":"White Pine County","32510":"Carson City"},"pl":{},"cols":["id","level","title","office","district","kind","nonpartisan","seats","scope","county","choices","certified total","file","other years","jurisdiction","office kind","counties"],"c":[["president","federal","PRESIDENT","President of the United States","","c",0,1,"statewide","",[["Harris, Kamala D.","DEM",705197,0,0],["Oliver, Chase","LPN",6059,0,0],["Skousen, Joel","IAP",2754,0,0],["Trump, Donald J.","REP",751